blocks.formulaBody:
A set V with addition (u + v) and scalar multiplication (c v) such
   that for all u, v, w in V and scalars c, d:
     closure: u + v in V and c v in V;
     u + v = v + u;  (u + v) + w = u + (v + w);
     there is a zero vector 0 with v + 0 = v;
     each v has an additive inverse -v with v + (-v) = 0;
     c(u + v) = cu + cv;  (c + d)v = cv + dv;  c(dv) = (cd)v;  1v = v.

