blocks.formulaBody:
A subset W of a vector space V is a SUBSPACE iff
     (1) W contains the zero vector;
     (2) closed under addition: u, v in W => u + v in W;
     (3) closed under scalar multiplication: v in W, c scalar => c v in W.
   ((2) and (3) together mean closure under linear combinations.)

